My mother had trouble bearing children. Went through two miscarriages. Bad ones. And when it finally happened... I wasn't easy either. Delivery took almost twenty- four hours. She said all she saw looking up into that hot bright light in the hospital room was the sun. 48.
ຄູຝຶກ ແຮຣິງ?

